.TH "TODOPRO ENCRYPTION SHOW-RECOVERY" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro encryption show-recovery Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-encryption\-show-recovery \- [Discontinued] Display an E2EE recovery...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro encryption show-recovery
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
[Discontinued] Display an E2EE recovery phrase (ADR-0024).
.PP
E2EE has been dropped as a shipped feature. There is no recovery phrase to
display — nothing can enable encryption any more, so no key is in use.
See `docs/adr/ADR-0024-drop-e2ee.md`.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-y,\fP \-\-yes
Ignored (kept for backwards compatibility)
